                          International School Brunei (ISB), Jerudong International School (JIS) and Miftah An Nur Islamic International School, taking into consideration that
                          these schools use international curriculum instead of National Education System for the 21st Century (SPN21) curriculum.
                   (2)  Pelajar-pelajar bagi Darjah Pra, 1, 2 dan 3 adalah terdiri daripada pelajar-pelajar dari Sekolah Antarabangsa Brunei (ISB), Sekolah Antarabangsa
                           Jerudong (JIS) dan Sekolah Antarabangsa Islamik Miftah An Nur.
                          The students in Pre-Year, Year 1, Year 2 and Year 3 consist of students from the International School Brunei (ISB), Jerudong International School (JIS)
                           and Miftah An Nur Islamic International School.
